								"html": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tHomelessness can happen to anyone. As of 2021, approximately 11.6% of Americans were living in poverty.&nbsp;Housing insecurity is not limited to a certain “type” of person. It can happen to virtually anyone at any time.\n</p>",
